    "turn_idx": 2,
    "turn_text": "Senator, as we speak, Democrats have agreed to a three and a half trillion dollar budget reconciliation bill. And as I understand, that comes on top of the 1.2 trillion in the bipartisan infrastructure plan. Can you speak to the details of the spending package? And is there any concern about the budget deficit that's already over two trillion this year?",
