        "confidence": 0.9
      },
      {
        "text": "The senator is expected to have detailed knowledge of the proposed spending package and its financial implications.",
        "confidence": 0.87
      },
      {
        "text": "The audience considers the size of the federal budget deficit to be a significant economic concern.",
