        "confidence": 0.91
      },
      {
        "text": "The current market structure allows for price increases at the consumer level without corresponding benefits to upstream producers.",
        "confidence": 0.89
      },
      {
        "text": "It is reasonable to expect that stakeholders like ranchers and calf producers would benefit from increased demand reflected in consumer pricing.",
        "confidence": 0.87
