  {
    "episode_id": 72696,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/7/2/72696.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 15,
    "turn_text": "Well, I can tell you that there's some that I'm probably concerned about and others that I'm less concerned about. I think you got to treat animals humanely. And you don't want them, you don't want them walking around and need deep crap. Let's just put it that way. And so, you know, the good operators, that doesn't happen. And so, I don't know that you can drop them all into the same bucket as the problem Jeff.",
